# Artifacts of a desktop packaging run. The scripts that write them do not live on
# every branch, but the files they leave behind outlive a branch switch — an ignore
# rule only where the generator lives leaves 340 MB of unpacked app untracked and
# unignored in every other working copy, one `git add -A` away from a commit.
#   bin/    — generated `penguin` / `penguin.cmd` CLI launchers
#   out/    — electron-builder output
#   skills/ — a copy of packages/skills/skills, which is tracked at its source
#   stage/  — the assembled app directory, on branches that stage before packing
bin/
out/
skills/
stage/
